                "2023-01-01 12:00:00", "2023-05-01 12:00:00");
            System.out.println(result3);
            // Output would include: {humanReadable="more than a month ago", ...}
        } catch (ParseException e) {
            System.out.println("Invalid date format");
        }
    }
}
```

## Constraints
1. The date-time strings will always be in "yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss" format if they are valid
