1. All class and method signatures must match exactly as specified
2. Do not modify the given field declarations
3. Address generation must use UUID (first 8 characters) as shown
4. Status strings must follow the exact format specified
5. Handle all edge cases (null/empty inputs, non-existent services)

## Evaluation Criteria
Your solution will be tested against multiple scenarios including:
- Service registration with valid and invalid parameters
- Message routing to existing and non-existing services
- Correct status reporting after multiple messages
- Proper handling of edge cases

