- Validates inputs:
  - Throws IllegalArgumentException if phoneNumber is null/empty
  - Throws IllegalArgumentException if password is null/empty
  - Throws IllegalArgumentException if phoneNumber length != 10
- Checks if user exists in userDatabase
- Verifies password matches stored password
- Generates and stores verification code for successful authentications
- Returns AuthenticationResult with appropriate status code and message

### verifyCode(String phoneNumber, String code)
