1. All method signatures must match exactly as shown
2. Use proper access modifiers (public/private) as specified
3. Maintain all field declarations exactly as shown
4. Handle edge cases (null inputs, missing fragments) appropriately
5. The nested `Fragment` class must remain static

## Notes
- You don't need to implement actual Android fragment transactions
- Focus on the core management logic
- The test cases verify all required functionality, but don't look at them while implementing

