        // Previous implementation: isValidBSTHelper(node.right, node.value + 1, maxVal)
        // When node.value = Integer.MAX_VALUE, node.value + 1 overflows to Integer.MIN_VALUE
        // This would make the right child constraint: value must be >= Integer.MIN_VALUE
        // which is always true, allowing invalid BST structures

        // Current implementation: isValidBST(node.right, node.value, upper)
